["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why Conversations Go Wrong machine gun questions a vision of sanity a rhetoric of good intentions lies of omission difficult conversations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-hiddenbrain-对话出问题-多半不是恶意-是节奏没对上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>对话出问题，多半不是恶意，是节奏没对上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一段沉默，在一方是礼貌等待，在另一方是冷场；打断是两个人共同完成的，一个人开始说，另一个人停下来。误解难解，是因为我们根本没有谈论这一层的语言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">沟通</span><span class=\"tag\">跨文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"鹿客陈彬：把一家 12 年的硬件公司，重写成 AI 原生组织 HARO FDE Agent Builder AI Buff IPD SP / BP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cn18b4d2-ai-原生组织不是人人用-ai-是假设组织不存在重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI炼金术</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 原生组织不是人人用 AI，是假设组织不存在重写一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鹿客把 HR 和 IT 合并成 HARO，让技术出身的人管人和 AI；圈长拿奖金包分配权，招人要先证明 AI 干不了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生组织</span><span class=\"tag\">组织变革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Philippe Pinel mental alienation moral treatment nosography phrenology Thermidorian Reaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-stuffmissed-他解开了精神病人的锁链-却造出了心理锁链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>他解开了精神病人的锁链，却造出了心理锁链</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Pinel 让 Bicêtre 的死亡率一年内从 50% 降到 13% 以下，靠的主要是清洁；但他否认脑器质性病因，被福柯指为用心理锁链替换了铁锁链。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神病学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Charged Black Holes and Charged Particle Production - Mykhaylo Usatyuk near extremal black hole Schwarzian modes superradiance Schwinger pair production worldline instanton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-instituteforad-带电黑洞发射带电粒子-量子引力修正几乎不起作用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff68ea9159caf005-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>带电黑洞发射带电粒子，量子引力修正几乎不起作用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">近极端黑洞的量子修正会大幅改写光子与引力子的霍金谱，但换成带电粒子，修正几乎消失——因为粒子大多在远离视界的喉部产生，感受不到视界附近的度规涨落。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Incentives Are for Losers (with Adam Mastroianni) Rube Goldberg machine big fish obedience to the unenforceable blackpilled\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-econtalk-遵守激励是失败者行为-你该自己判断对错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>遵守激励是失败者行为：你该自己判断对错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">经济学家说改好激励就能改好世界，Mastroianni 说这漏了一半：就算你有理由做坏事，你也不该做。把价值判断外包给激励结构，是放弃了做人的核心任务。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激励机制</span><span class=\"tag\">学术生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Greg Brockman on Why OpenAI Says We’re Entering the AGI Era jagged frontier pacing the frontier defense factory trusted access program Lean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-a16z-openai-宣布进入-agi-时代-但算力不够分给所有人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 宣布进入 AGI 时代，但算力不够分给所有人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Greg Brockman 说 Astra 能连续跑 24 小时完成任务，可以叫 AGI；真正的瓶颈不是模型能力，而是算力和安全对齐，模型再强也未必能便宜地送到每个人手里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Six Tokens To Own This Cycle | Yan Liberman cashmaxing reflexive assets regulatory ARB emerging managers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-empire-ai-抢走人才后-加密的机会只剩六种代币/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ee6bb56a5beaa83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">59:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 抢走人才后，加密的机会只剩六种代币</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Delphi 的 Yan Liberman 说，加密风投一年只出手一笔，因为 AI 把聪明人全吸走了；真正能赚钱的只剩少数有真实收入、且不依赖加密行情的代币。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密投资</span><span class=\"tag\">代币组合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Living with uncertainty need for cognitive closure aporia why chaining\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-startweek-保健品卖的不是疗效-是替你承受不确定性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>保健品卖的不是疗效，是替你承受不确定性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球每年花60亿美元买更年期补充剂，英国同年只花6000万研究更年期；胶原蛋白从每公斤15英镑的屠宰废料变成货架上300英镑的美容品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">健康消费</span><span class=\"tag\">补充剂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Adam Conover explains how YouTube ruined everything in the black vaporware upfronts AVOD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-decoder-youtube-是比电视台更糟的守门人-因为你没法跟算法谈判/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9e71199cd5ad416-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>YouTube 是比电视台更糟的守门人，因为你没法跟算法谈判</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喜剧演员 Adam Conover 说，好莱坞为了追 Netflix 亲手毁掉有线电视，把游戏节目、日间秀、生活类节目整片让给 YouTube；而 YouTube 的算法是个无法交涉、无法施压的守门人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span><span class=\"tag\">YouTube</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI President Greg Brockman on Doing Business in the Wake of Hugging Face chain of thought monitorability reward hacking grader preparedness framework responsible scaling policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-oddlots-openai-总裁承认-安全标准要提前到训练阶段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 总裁承认：安全标准要提前到训练阶段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件后，OpenAI 把安全审查从部署阶段前移到开发与评测阶段，并放慢了部分训练运行——这是它自己说的最大转折点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Thrive Causemetics: Karissa Bodnar. How a Beauty Business Made Millions for a Mission direct-to-consumer term sheet co-manufacturer one for one\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-howibuilt-美妆品牌靠使命卖货-其实产品才是命根子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">48:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>美妆品牌靠使命卖货，其实产品才是命根子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Thrive Causemetics 先做出一款给化疗掉睫毛的人用的假睫毛，再靠一条 iPhone 广告在七天内把日销从 5000 美元推到 10 万美元。创始人说，使命决定复购，但产品决定生死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">D2C</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: How LPs Allocate to Venture in 2026: What They Want, What They Do Not Want | Why Fund Multiple Does Not Matter Without a Timeline | Why Velocity of Cashback is the Most Important Thing with David Morehead, CIO @ Baylor velocity of capital fund of one J curve commingled fund denominator effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-twentyvc-大学捐赠基金-cio-基金年限太长-gp-和我们的数学根本不一致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5f22493ad40ee05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>大学捐赠基金 CIO：基金年限太长，GP 和我们的数学根本不一致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募存在的唯一理由就是赚钱——但 15 到 18 年的基金期限让 GP 的激励和捐赠基金的复利数学错位。真正该追的不是资本回报率，而是资本周转速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LP视角</span><span class=\"tag\">资产配置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Norway’s teacher resistance in World War Two Quisling Quisling Youth Service Gestapo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-witness-挪威教师拒绝教纳粹课-占领者输掉了学校/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>挪威教师拒绝教纳粹课，占领者输掉了学校</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">德国四周拿下挪威南部，却四年没能拿下挪威的课堂：14000名教师中12000人拒绝加入纳粹教师工会，1000多人被送进集中营，回来后仍不是会员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二战</span><span class=\"tag\">挪威</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Home Depot rapid deployment center market delivery operations direct fulfillment center stack &#x27;em high, watch &#x27;em fly Six Sigma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-acquired-home-depot-上市以来回报第一-靠的不是卖便宜货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a629c40221e1a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>Home Depot 上市以来回报第一，靠的不是卖便宜货</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它把教育打包进零售：顾客问怎么修，店员就停下来教。25 美分的垫圈能带出十万美元的厨房翻新，这种价值没法用 Six Sigma 表格管理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 400: Dennett Rejects Qualia (Part One) qualia Cartesian theater access consciousness multiple drafts model center of gravity heterophenomenology\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-pel-丹尼特否认感受质-颜色不在外面-也不在里面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f8ad674feef51a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>丹尼特否认感受质：颜色不在外面，也不在里面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">丹尼特不否认我们觉得有感受质，他否认的是感受质这个被实体化的东西存在——就像重心是抽象，不是身体里的一个点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">丹尼特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The KGB Double Agent Who Stopped Armageddon with Ben McIntyre MICE RockX Minox Tudeh Party brush contact dead drop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyhit-一个苏联间谍的难言之隐-差点阻止了第三次世界大战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f92a8a9105bdcbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>一个苏联间谍的难言之隐，差点阻止了第三次世界大战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1981年，克格勃驻德黑兰高官主动向MI6投诚，动机不是钱也不是意识形态，而是他相信西方能治好他的性功能障碍——他交出的情报，让美英决定把苏联政变计划交给伊朗人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">间谍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"646: The Secret of My Death Memento Mori medevac frogman\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tal-死后你留下的不是死因-是别人拼凑的你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25f52c21084864d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>死后你留下的不是死因，是别人拼凑的你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三个故事都在做同一件事：人死后，亲友只能靠短信、讣告、Facebook 留言这些零碎证据去还原一个已经无法开口的人——而拼出来的那个版本，往往和本人认知完全对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">叙事播客</span><span class=\"tag\">死亡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neurodiversity, Autism, Awe, and Religious Experience (with Jonathan Machnee) neurodivergent profound autism cognitive dissonance pressure cooker collective effervescence double empathy problem cessationism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-clearerthink-自闭症不是一条线-是十维谱系加四个遗传簇/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>自闭症不是一条线，是十维谱系加四个遗传簇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DSM-5 把马斯克和无法自己穿衣服的人塞进同一个桶，但自闭症没有生物标志物，只有四个遗传簇和一堆被误读的标签。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经多样性</span><span class=\"tag\">自闭症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"E199 AI投研的边界、能力与实战卡点 I David对话岗底斯首席 FDE FDE MOE Harness ETL QA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-touzishizhan-ai-不会让普通人变优秀-只会让优秀的人更优秀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不会让普通人变优秀，只会让优秀的人更优秀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投研 Agent 的卡点不在模型，在数据治理和人的判断力；用海外模型会让你越来越笨，用国内模型逼你越来越聪明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投研</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"705. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: The Mad Emperor of Abyssinia (Part 1) Abyssinia Magdala Theodros II Hormuzd Rassam Walter Plowden Charles Duncan Cameron\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-restishistory-英国远征阿比西尼亚-一个皇帝把外交官全扣了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>英国远征阿比西尼亚：一个皇帝把外交官全扣了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">维多利亚女王没回一封信，特沃德罗斯二世就把英国领事、传教士全锁进马格达拉山顶，等来的是一支远征军。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝国史</span><span class=\"tag\">埃塞俄比亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silicon Valley’s Starving for Compute Neocloud Neolab reticle panel level packaging RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-asianometry-2027-年算力会从短缺变成过剩-ai-泡沫未必破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bde50d837c58c490-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>2027 年算力会从短缺变成过剩，AI 泡沫未必破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年底可用 AI 数据中心约 15 吉瓦，2027 年底冲到 45-55 吉瓦，增量 30-40 吉瓦。按每吉瓦 500 亿美元收入算，两家巨头要做出 7500 亿到 1.5 万亿美元，这个数字站不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"395. Stalin: The Rise of A Tyrant (Part 1) Koba Bolsheviks / Mensheviks Russification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-empirehist-斯大林在革命里只是个管账的-后来却成了总书记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">33:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>斯大林在革命里只是个管账的，后来却成了总书记</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1917年列宁和托洛茨基在街头号召起义时，斯大林在做没人愿意干的组织与筹款工作。他后来成为总书记，靠的不是演说，而是坐在桌边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏联史</span><span class=\"tag\">权力结构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"8 Ways To Improve Your Outbound Sales outbound intent signals breakup message deliverability Sales Navigator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ycsp-外联回复率接近零-先别怪文案-先查你在发给谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b47caf90a5aa280a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">12:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>外联回复率接近零，先别怪文案，先查你在发给谁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">外联像大海捞针：人不对，再完美的文案也不会落地。YC 合伙人给出的调试顺序是——先查收件人、再查公司、再看标题，最后才轮到文案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">外联销售</span><span class=\"tag\">早期创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"World Models, Robotics, and the Future of 3D AI world model Gaussian splat real to sim bullet time SFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-a16z-世界模型不是视频生成-atlas-把-3d-控制做成了输入/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是视频生成：Atlas 把 3D 控制做成了输入</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言模型处理 token，世界模型处理物理空间。Atlas 的关键不是生成更长的视频，而是把相机和参考图放进 3D 坐标里当输入，让生成从老虎机变成导演。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">3D 生成</span>\n</div></div></a>"]